<title>USA: Superior Industries wins Ford contract.</title>
<headline>Superior Industries wins Ford contract.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Industries International Inc on Tuesday said it has won a multi-million dollar, multi-year contract to supply three aluminum road wheel styles for Ford Motor Co's 1998 Lincoln Navigator, a sport utility vehicle.</p>
<p>The contract's terms were undisclosed.</p>
<p>Superior Industries is a leading manufacturer of accessory products for automotive markets.</p>
</text>
